The statement must remain visible and must not be removed in later updates.

## 2. Attribution in every distributed app

If you publish an application (APK, AAB, or store listing) that is based on
this project or includes substantial portions of its code, you must provide
user-visible credit, for example in Settings → About or an equivalent screen:

